1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
11 Nov: a Russian warship is hit off
Suursaari, 40 km from Finland.

2
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:10,000
Finland’s Defence Forces: no immediate
military threat.

3
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:14,600
21 Nov. A cargo ship on fire in the same
gulf.

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:19,600
Finland closes the sky and sea of the
eastern gulf. Again.

5
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:24,950
The official word, 11 Nov: the situation
remains “stable.”
